</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">장애인복지카드 및 장애인 증명서(1~3급)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #ea2d2d 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 76.61pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 34.02pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #ea2d2d 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">주민자치센터</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #ea2d2d 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ea2d2d 1px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 90.76pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 48.17pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #ea2d2d 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가계곤란자</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #ea2d2d 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 237.92pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 48.17pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #ea2d2d 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">＊</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">건강보험료 납부확인서 및 건강보험증 사본</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">＊기타 가계곤란 증빙서류</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #ea2d2d 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 76.61pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 48.17pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #ea2d2d 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">국민건강보험공단 </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 가구별 소득합산대상 : 미혼자(본인+부모), 기혼자(본인+배우자)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 선발대상 및 선발순위</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가. 선발대상 </span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 72.13pt