IGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대학원생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(일반,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">산업및교육)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 360.03pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 75.11pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 6.7pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 학비마련에 어려움이 있는 가계곤란 학생으로 해당 대학원의 심사 결과 선정된 학생(스마일장학금 신청자에 한함)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 6.7pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ 소득 5분위 이내의 학생을 선발하되, 장학금 재원에 따라 7분위까지 확대하여 선발</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #fb861f 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 38.88pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 75.11pt; COLOR: #000; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #fb861f 1px solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" cols=\"1\" rows=\"1\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-RIGHT: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 선발순위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가구별·소득수준별 건강보험료 산정기준표<font size=\"3\" face=\"\">〔</font>붙임서식2<font size=\"3\" face=\"\">〕</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1순위 : 기초생활수급자, 본인장애급수 1급 ~ 3급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 2순위 : 차상위계층 및 의료급여수급자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3순위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">소득 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1~5분위 이하 또는 건강보험료가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">전국가구 평균소득 100%이하 가구</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4순위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">소득 6</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">~7분위 이하 또는 건강보험료가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">전국가구 평균소득 120%이하 가구</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 소득 1~7분위 선발순위 : 학과(전공)별 저소득자 순으로 선발</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 지급방법 : 등록금 고지면제</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 장학금액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; 가.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 가계곤란 정도 및 소득분위에 따라 차등 지급 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나 지급금액 : 등록금의 전액 또는 일부 감면</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"전 조문\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">8. 장학생 선발 제외 대상 학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; 가. 2013학년도 전기 신입생 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 수업연한 초과학생 장학생 선발 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 다. 외국인 학생 선발 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 라. 휴학예정자 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 마</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. 등록금 초과 장학금 지급 금지 : 등록금 범위내에서 교외장학금과 이중지급 금지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 바. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-fa